      *
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO   WS-DIGITO
      *
           MOVE   RUCLS-NU-INATIVA   TO   WS-CALCULO.
           COMPUTE   WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 10 ) * 02 ).
           COMPUTE   WS-DIGITO  =  WS-DIGITO  +  WS-INAT-1 + WS-INAT-2.
      *
           COMPUTE WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 11 ) * 01).
           COMPUTE WS-DIGITO    =  WS-DIGITO   +
                                   WS-INAT-1 + WS-INAT-2.
           COMPUTE WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 12 ) * 02).
           COMPUTE WS-DIGITO    =  WS-DIGITO      +
                                   WS-INAT-1 + WS-INAT-2.
           COMPUTE WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 13 ) * 01).
           COMPUTE WS-DIGITO    =  WS-DIGITO      +
                                   WS-INAT-1 + WS-INAT-2.
           COMPUTE WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 14 ) * 02).
           COMPUTE WS-DIGITO    =  WS-DIGITO      +
                                   WS-INAT-1 + WS-INAT-2.
           COMPUTE WS-INAT-CALC = ( WS-NUMERO( 15 ) * 01).
           COMPUTE WS-DIGITO    =  WS-DIGITO      +
