      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-DV-DEBITO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   RUCLS-NU-CARTAO-DEBITO   NOT  NUMERIC
             MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
             PERFORM   900-ERROR
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE   RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO(1:1)    TO   WS-TIPO-CARTAO.
      *
VCAD       IF     WS-TIPO-CARTAO    EQUAL   ZEROS
V012  *           MOVE RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO(7:1)    TO WS-TIPO-CARTAO
V012              MOVE RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO(4:1)    TO WS-TIPO-CARTAO
VCAD       END-IF
      *
           IF   WS-TIPO-CARTAO   EQUAL   6
             PERFORM   116-01-MAESTRO   THRU   116-01-FIM
           ELSE
             IF   WS-TIPO-CARTAO   EQUAL   4 OR
                  WS-TIPO-CARTAO   EQUAL   5
               PERFORM   116-02-VISAELECTRON   THRU   116-02-FIM
             ELSE
               MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
               PERFORM   900-ERROR
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-01-MAESTRO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *    MOVE   RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO    TO   WS-CALCULO.
           MOVE   RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO    TO   WS-CALC-INVER.
           MOVE   ZEROS                  TO   WS-SOMA-DEBITO.
      *
           PERFORM  200-INVERTE        THRU   200-FIM.
      *
           PERFORM VARYING   WS-IND    FROM      1 BY 1
                   UNTIL     WS-IND    GREATER   18
                   DIVIDE    WS-IND    BY        2
                   GIVING    TALLY     REMAINDER WS-RESTO-DEBITO
             IF   WS-RESTO-DEBITO    EQUAL   ZEROS
                  MOVE   1              TO   WS-PESO-DEBITO
             ELSE
                  MOVE   2              TO   WS-PESO-DEBITO
             END-IF
             COMPUTE   WS-PRODUTO-DEBITO    EQUAL
               WS-NUMERO( WS-IND ) * WS-PESO-DEBITO
             COMPUTE   WS-SOMA-DEBITO      EQUAL
               WS-SOMA-DEBITO + WS-PROD1-DEBITO + WS-PROD2-DEBITO
           END-PERFORM.
      *
           IF   WS-ACUM-CALC3-DEBITO  EQUAL   ZEROS
                MOVE   0                 TO   RUCLS-DV-CARTAO-DEBITO
           ELSE
             COMPUTE   RUCLS-DV-CARTAO-DEBITO   =
                      (10 - WS-ACUM-CALC3-DEBITO)
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-01-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-02-VISAELECTRON.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           MOVE   RUCLS-CARTAO-DEBITO   TO   WS-CALCULO.
           MOVE   ZEROS                 TO   WS-SOMA-DEBITO.
      *
           PERFORM VARYING   WS-IND    FROM        1   BY   1
                   UNTIL     WS-IND    GREATER     18
                   DIVIDE    WS-IND    BY          2
                   GIVING    TALLY     REMAINDER   WS-RESTO-DEBITO
             IF   WS-RESTO-DEBITO    EQUAL   ZEROS
               MOVE   2                 TO   WS-PESO-DEBITO
             ELSE
               MOVE   1                 TO   WS-PESO-DEBITO
             END-IF
      *
             COMPUTE
                 WS-PRODUTO-DEBITO EQUAL
                 WS-NUMERO( WS-IND )   *   WS-PESO-DEBITO
      *
             COMPUTE  WS-SOMA-DEBITO  EQUAL  WS-SOMA-DEBITO +
                                             WS-PROD1-DEBITO +
                                             WS-PROD2-DEBITO
           END-PERFORM.
      *
           DIVIDE  WS-SOMA-DEBITO  BY   10
                           GIVING     TALLY
                           REMAINDER  WS-RESTO.
      *
           IF   WS-RESTO          EQUAL   ZEROS
                MOVE   ZEROS         TO   RUCLS-DV-CARTAO-DEBITO
           ELSE
                COMPUTE  RUCLS-DV-CARTAO-DEBITO  =  10  -  WS-RESTO
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       116-02-FIM.   EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       117-DV-REMESSA.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   RUCLS-NU-REMESSA   NOT   NUMERIC
             MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
             PERFORM   900-ERROR
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE    RUCLS-REMESSA-REGISTRADA TO   WS-CALCULO.
      *
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA =
                 ((WS-NUMERO(01) * 08) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(02) * 06) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(03) * 04) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(04) * 02) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(05) * 03) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(06) * 05) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(07) * 09) +
                  (WS-NUMERO(08) * 07)).
      *
           DIVIDE  WS-SOMA   BY  11    GIVING    TALLY
                                       REMAINDER WS-RESTO.
      *
           IF   WS-RESTO   EQUAL   0
             MOVE   5   TO   RUCLS-DV-REMESSA
           ELSE
             IF   WS-RESTO   EQUAL   1
               MOVE  0   TO   RUCLS-DV-REMESSA
             ELSE
               COMPUTE   RUCLS-DV-REMESSA    =   11 - WS-RESTO
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       117-FIM. EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       119-DV-CARTAO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           MOVE   RUCLS-CARTAO(1:1)   TO   WS-TIPO-CARTAO.
      *
           IF   WS-TIPO-CARTAO   NOT NUMERIC
             MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
             PERFORM 900-ERROR
           END-IF.
      *
           IF   WS-TIPO-CARTAO   EQUAL   3
             PERFORM   119-02-DINNERS   THRU   119-02-FIM
           ELSE
             IF   WS-TIPO-CARTAO   EQUAL   4   OR   5  OR  6
               PERFORM   119-01-VISA-MASTERCARD   THRU   119-01-FIM
             ELSE
               MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
               PERFORM   900-ERROR
             END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       119-FIM. EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       119-01-VISA-MASTERCARD.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   RUCLS-NU-CARTAO  OF  RUCLS-VISA-MASTERCARD
                NOT NUMERIC
             MOVE   02   TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
             PERFORM   900-ERROR
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE    RUCLS-CARTAO   TO   WS-CALCULO.
      *
      *    COMPUTE WS-SOMA =
      *          ((WS-NUMERO(05) * 05) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(06) * 04) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(07) * 03) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(08) * 02) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(09) * 07) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(10) * 06) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(11) * 05) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(12) * 04) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(13) * 03) +
      *           (WS-NUMERO(14) * 02)).
      *
      *    DIVIDE  WS-SOMA   BY  11    GIVING    TALLY
      *                                REMAINDER WS-RESTO.
      *
      *    IF   WS-RESTO   LESS   2
      *      MOVE   ZEROS   TO   WS-DIGITO-1
      *    ELSE
      *      COMPUTE   WS-DIGITO-1   =   11   -   WS-RESTO
      *    END-IF.
      *
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(01) =   (WS-NUMERO(01) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(02) =   (WS-NUMERO(02) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(03) =   (WS-NUMERO(03) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(04) =   (WS-NUMERO(04) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(05) =   (WS-NUMERO(05) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(06) =   (WS-NUMERO(06) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(07) =   (WS-NUMERO(07) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(08) =   (WS-NUMERO(08) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(09) =   (WS-NUMERO(09) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(10) =   (WS-NUMERO(10) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(11) =   (WS-NUMERO(11) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(12) =   (WS-NUMERO(12) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(13) =   (WS-NUMERO(13) * 02)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(14) =   (WS-NUMERO(14) * 01)
           COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(15) =   (WS-NUMERO(15) * 02)
      *** ALTERACAO EFETUADA EM 11/05/2006
      *    COMPUTE   WS-DUAS-CASAS(15) =   (WS-DIGITO-1   * 02)
      *
           MOVE   ZEROS   TO   WS-SOMA
           PERFORM   VARYING   WS-IND  FROM  1   BY   1
                     UNTIL   WS-IND = 16
