       132-DV-JCB.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *
           IF   RUCLS-NU-JCB     IS NOT   NUMERIC
                MOVE    02           TO   RUCLS-CODIGO-RETORNO
                PERFORM              900-ERROR
           END-IF
      *
      ***** FASE 1
      ***** DOBRAR OS NUMEROS PARTINDO DO ULTIMO E PULANDO O
      *     PROXIMO
      *
           MOVE   RUCLS-NU-JCB       TO   WS-CALC-JCB.
      *
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(08) =  WS-NU-JCB(15) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(07) =  WS-NU-JCB(13) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(06) =  WS-NU-JCB(11) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(05) =  WS-NU-JCB(09) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(04) =  WS-NU-JCB(07) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(03) =  WS-NU-JCB(05) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(02) =  WS-NU-JCB(03) * 02
           COMPUTE WS-DB-JCB(01) =  WS-NU-JCB(01) * 02
      *
      ***** FASE 2
      ***** SOMAR OS DIGITOS DE CADA RESULTADO ACIMA ADICIONANDO
      ***** O DIGITO SUBSEQUENTE E TOTALIZANDO-OS
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(01)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB +  WS-SE-JCB1 +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  +  WS-NU-JCB(02)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(02)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1  +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  + WS-NU-JCB(04)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(03)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1  +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  + WS-NU-JCB(06)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(04)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1  +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  + WS-NU-JCB(08)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(05)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1  +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  + WS-NU-JCB(10)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(06)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1  +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2 + WS-NU-JCB(12)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(07)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB +  WS-SE-JCB1 +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2  +  WS-NU-JCB(14)
      *
           MOVE    WS-DB-JCB(08)    TO     WS-SEPARA-JCB
           COMPUTE WS-SOMA-JCB  =  WS-SOMA-JCB + WS-SE-JCB1 +
                                   WS-SE-JCB2
      *
      ***** FASE 3
      ***** VERIFICA SE O ULTIMO DIGITO DA SOMA È ZERO SE N„O FOR
      ***** ACHA O DÌGITO
      *
           MOVE   WS-SOMA-JCB       TO     WS-SEPARA-SOMA
      *
           IF     WS-SE-SOMA3    EQUAL     ZEROS
                  MOVE    ZEROS     TO     RUCLS-DV-JCB
           ELSE
                  PERFORM   132-001-DV-JCB   THRU   132-001-FIM
                  UNTIL    WS-FIM-JCB   EQUAL   'S'
           END-IF.
